se CSV path\\n547|  - `def task_ingest(cfg, universe_path) -> str`      # raw stage path / manifest\\n548|  - `def task_transform(cfg) -> str`           # clean stage path\\n549|  - `def task_features(cfg) -> str`            # features stage path\\n550|  - `def task_signal(cfg) -> str`              # positions stage path\\n551|  - `def task_backtest(cfg) -> str`            # results stage path\\n552|  - `def task_report(cfg) -> Path`             # artifacts/report.md\\n553|- Consumes: all prior tasks' produced types; `LakeStore`; `Strategy`; `run_backtest`.\\n554|- File-based passing: each task reads its input stage from the lake and writes its output\\n555|  stage → no in-memory handoff between tasks.\\n556|\\n557|**Pseudocode (each body is a thin delegation to the module it wraps):**\\n558|```\\n559|def task_universe(cfg):        u=snapshot(fetch(cfg));  return path\\n560|def task_ingest(cfg, upath):   tickers=read(upath); recs=ingest(tickers,cfg); return store.raw_path()\\n561|def task_transform(cfg):       return store.read(Stage.CLEAN).path     # raises on gate fail\\n562|def task_features(cfg):        build_features(read_clean, store, cfg); return store.path(STAGE.FEATURES)\\n563|def task_signal(cfg):          MomentumStrategy(cfg).generate_target_weights(...) -> positions\\n564|def task_backtest(cfg):        run_backtest(read_prices, read_positions, cfg) -> results\\n565|def task_report(cfg):          write_report(read_results, metrics, cfg.artifacts_dir)\\n566|```\\n567|**Definition of done:** the full chain `task_universe → … → task_report` runs on the synthetic\\n568|fixtures (no Airflow, no network) and each stage's row counts are consistent end-to-end.\\n569|\\n570|---\\n571|\\n572|## Task 14: Airflow DAG (thin wrapper)\\n573|\\n574|**Files:**\\n575|- Create: `dags/momentum_dag.py`, `tests/test_dag_wiring.py`, `docker-compose.yaml`\\n576|\\n577|**Interfaces:**\\n578|- Consumes: `spx_momentum.pipeline.tasks.*` (imports the task functions only).\\n579|- Pr