 Quickstart\\n\\n```\\nmake sync        # uv sync --all-extras\\nmake test        # pytest (network-free)\\nmake lint        # ruff + mypy\\nmake run-dag     # Airflow via docker compose\\nmake dashboard   # Streamlit dashboard\\n```\\n\\n## Guarantees (DESIGN-DOC §4.4–§4.5)\\n\\n- **Deterministic:** backtest + report are pure functions of stored tables;\\n  rerunnable without network.\\n- **Idempotent:** every stage upserts into its own lake dir keyed by\\n  (ticker, date); safe reruns, no duplicate accumulation.\\n- **Isolated:** one dead ticker never fails the DAG; failures are recorded in\\n  a fetch manifest.\\n- **Honest:** survivorship bias + 12-1 lookback documented in\\n  `docs/methodology.md`; no live/paper trading, ever.\\n===PYPROJECT===\\n# spx-momentum — scaffold per docs/superpowers/plans/2026-10-05-spx-momentum-scaffold.md\\n# Spec: DESIGN-DOC.md §4.3. uv-managed; ruff/mypy/pytest config inline.\\n[project]\\nname = \\\"spx-momentum\\\"\\nversion = \\\"0.1.0\\\"\\ndescription = \\\"S&P 500 cross-sectional momentum: data pipeline + custom backtester (research demo)\\\"\\nreadme = \\\"README.md\\\"\\nrequires-python = \\\">=3.12,<3.13\\\"\\ndependencies = [\\n    \\\"pandas>=2.2\\\",\\n    \\\"numpy>=1.26\\\",\\n    \\\"duckdb>=1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"pydantic>=2.7\\\",\\n    \\\"pydantic-settings>=2.3\\\",\\n    \\\"yfinance>=0.2.40\\\",\\n    \\\"PyYAML>=6.0\\\",\\n    \\\"streamlit>=1.36\\\",\\n    \\\"matplotlib>=3.9\\\",\\n]\\n\\n[project.optional-dependencies]\\ndev = [\\n    \\\"pytest>=8.2\\\",\\n    \\\"ruff>=0.5\\\",\\n    \\\"mypy>=1.10\\\",\\n    \\\"pre-commit>=3.7\\\",\\n    \\\"apache-airflow>=2.9\\\",\\n]\\n\\n[project.scripts]\\nspx-dashboard = \\\"spx_momentum.ui.dashboard:main\\\"\\n\\n[build-system]\\nrequires = [\\\"hatchling\\\"]\\nbuild-backend = \\\"hatchling.build\\\"\\n\\n[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel]\\npackages = [\\\"src/spx_momentum\\\"]\\n\\n[tool.ruff]\\nline-length = 100\\ntarget-version = \\\"py312\\\"\\nextend-exclude = 