s=factor (start=1.0)\\n19|    trade_log: pd.DataFrame  # (date, ticker, w_before, w_after, cost)\\n20|    exposure: pd.Series      # index=date, values=1.0 or 0.0 (full investment)\\n21|    terminal_value: float\\n22|\\n23|\\n24|def run_backtest(\\n25|    prices: pd.DataFrame,\\n26|    positions: PositionSet,\\n27|    cfg: Settings,\\n28|) -> BacktestResult:\\n29|    \\\"\\\"\\\"Plan Task 10 contract.\\n30|\\n31|    For each schedule date in `positions.dates`:\\n32|      1. turnover  = 0.5 * sum(|w_new - w_prev|)       (w_prev zero on day 1)\\n33|      2. cost      = apply_costs(turnover * equity, cfg.cost_bps, cfg.slippage_bps)\\n34|      3. equity   *= (1 - cost/equity)  ==  (1 - turnover*(bps) / 1e4)\\n35|      4. mark-to-market daily between rebalances:\\n36|         equity   *= prod(1 + sum w_i * r_i / day-holded)\\n37|\\n38|    INVARIANT: with cfg.cost_bps=cfg.slippage_bps=0, terminal_value equals the\\n39|    hand-computed geometric product of held returns (exact within 1e-9).\\n40|    Adding any bps strictly lowers terminal_value by a turnover-weighted amount.\\n41|    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n42|    raise NotImplementedError\", \"total_lines\": 42, \"file_size\": 1530, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false, \"not_found\": false}", "tool_call_id": "call_hmqn44ob", "tool_calls": null, "tool_name": "read_file", "effect_disposition": null, "timestamp": 1791385784.1991646, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": null, "reasoning": null, "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_details": null, "codex_reasoning_items": null, "codex_message_items": null, "platform_message_id": null, "observed": 0, "active": 1, "compacted": 0, "api_content": null, "display_kind": null, "display_metadata": null, "message_uid": "7a19c9fb931c429b8b6bf70aa25cde2b", "absorbed_message_uids": null, "tool_call_uids": null, "tool_call_uid": "d8bb48884b7046bd90e339e36fc13bfe"}, {"id": 525, "session_id": "20261007_095848_e788a7", "role": "tool", "content": "{\"content\": \"1|# Perfo